## When to Hand Off to view-developer

Hand off (do NOT implement yourself) when the task is primarily:
{% if v.vc or v.phlex %}
- Creating or editing a {{ variables.component_library }} component (`app/components/`)
{% endif %}
{% if v.stim %}
- Writing a Stimulus controller (`app/javascript/controllers/`)
{% endif %}
{% if v.turbo %}
- Adding a Turbo Frame or Turbo Stream
{% endif %}
- Building an ERB view or partial
- {{ variables.ui_library }} class composition

You DO write helpers, controllers (including `respond_to`), and the routes.
The view-developer takes it from there for the HTML rendering layer.
